 "documento": "MAT-2013-JUNIO.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sabiendo que \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x\\cos(x)+b\\,\\mathrm{sen}(x)}{x^3}\\) es finito, calcula \\(b\\) y el valor del límite.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En \\(x=0\\) numerador y denominador valen 0: es una indeterminación \\(\\frac00\\) para cualquier \\(b\\). Aplico la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x\\cos x+b\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{x^3}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\cos x-x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+b\\cos x}{3x^2}\\]<p>El denominador tiende a 0 y el numerador a \\(1+b\\). Si \\(1+b\\neq0\\), el límite sería infinito<i class='n' data-t='why'>Un número distinto de cero dividido entre algo que tiende a 0 da infinito: el límite no sería finito.</i>. Para que sea finito, \\(1+b=0\\iff\\boxed{b=-1}\\).</p><p>Con \\(b=-1\\) el numerador queda \\(\\cos x-x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-\\cos x=-x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{-x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{3x^2}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{3x}=\\left[\\frac00\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{-\\cos x}{3}=-\\frac13\\]<div class='res'>\\(b=-1\\) y el límite vale \\(-\\dfrac13\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2013-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas mediante \\(f(x)=|x(x-2)|\\) y \\(g(x)=x+4\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) sobre los mismos ejes. Calcula los puntos de corte entre ambas gráficas.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Quito el valor absoluto estudiando el signo de \\(x(x-2)\\), que se anula en \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\): es positivo fuera de \\([0,2]\\) y negativo dentro<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(|u|=u\\) si \\(u\\ge0\\) y \\(|u|=-u\\) si \\(u\\lt0\\).</i>:</p>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2-2x&\\text{si }x\\le0\\\\-x^2+2x&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\lt2\\\\x^2-2x&\\text{si }x\\ge2\\end{cases}\\]<p>Es la parábola \\(y=x^2-2x\\) con el trozo que queda por debajo del eje (entre 0 y 2) reflejado hacia arriba; tiene un máximo relativo en \\((1,1)\\). La gráfica de \\(g\\) es una recta.</p><p><b>Puntos de corte.</b></p><p>• Si \\(x\\le0\\) o \\(x\\ge2\\): \\(x^2-2x=x+4\\iff x^2-3x-4=0\\iff x=-1\\) o \\(x=4\\). Las dos valen.</p><p>• Si \\(0\\lt x\\lt2\\): \\(-x^2+2x=x+4\\iff x^2-x+4=0\\), sin soluciones reales (discriminante \\(1-16\\lt0\\)).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 240' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='51.5,143.8 54.0,142.6 56.4,141.4 58.9,140.2 61.4,139.0 63.8,137.9 66.3,136.7 68.8,135.5 71.2,134.3 73.7,133.1 76.1,131.9 78.6,130.7 81.1,129.5 83.5,128.3 86.0,127.1 88.4,126.0 90.9,124.8 93.4,123.6 95.8,122.4 98.3,121.2 100.8,120.0 103.2,118.8 105.7,117.6 108.1,116.4 110.6,115.2 113.1,114.0 115.5,112.9 118.0,111.7 120.5,110.5 122.9,109.3 125.4,108.1 127.8,106.9 130.3,105.7 132.8,104.5 135.2,103.3 137.7,102.1 140.2,101.0 142.6,99.8 145.1,98.6 147.5,97.4 150.0,96.2 152.5,95.0 154.9,93.8 157.4,92.6 159.8,91.4 162.3,90.2 164.8,89.0 167.2,87.9 169.7,86.7 172.2,85.5 174.6,84.3 177.1,83.1 179.5,81.9 182.0,80.7 184.5,79.5 186.9,78.3 189.4,77.1 191.9,76.0 194.3,74.8 196.8,73.6 199.2,72.4 201.7,71.2 204.2,70.0 206.6,68.8 209.1,67.6 211.6,66.4 214.0,65.2 216.5,64.0 218.9,62.9 221.4,61.7 223.9,60.5 226.3,59.3 228.8,58.1 231.2,56.9 233.7,55.7 236.2,54.5 238.6,53.3 241.1,52.1 243.6,51.0 246.0,49.8 248.5,48.6 248.5,48.6 246.0,55.6 243.6,62.6 241.1,69.3 238.6,76.0 236.2,82.4 233.7,88.8 231.2,94.9 228.8,101.0 226.3,106.8 223.9,112.6 221.4,118.1 218.9,123.6 216.5,128.9 214.0,134.0 211.6,139.0 209.1,143.8 206.6,148.5 204.2,153.0 201.7,157.4 199.2,161.7 196.8,165.8 194.3,169.7 191.9,173.5 189.4,177.1 186.9,180.6 184.5,184.0 182.0,187.2 179.5,190.2 177.1,193.1 174.6,195.9 172.2,198.5 169.7,201.0 167.2,198.6 164.8,196.5 162.3,194.5 159.8,192.6 157.4,190.9 154.9,189.3 152.5,187.9 150.0,186.7 147.5,185.6 145.1,184.6 142.6,183.8 140.2,183.1 137.7,182.6 135.2,182.2 132.8,182.0 130.3,181.9 127.8,182.0 125.4,182.2 122.9,182.6 120.5,183.1 118.0,183.8 115.5,184.6 113.1,185.6 110.6,186.7 108.1,187.9 105.7,189.3 103.2,190.9 100.8,192.6 98.3,194.5 95.8,196.5 93.4,198.6 90.9,201.0 88.4,198.5 86.0,195.9 83.5,193.1 81.1,190.2 78.6,187.2 76.1,184.0 73.7,180.6 71.2,177.1 68.8,173.5 66.3,169.7 63.8,165.8 61.4,161.7 58.9,157.4 56.4,153.0 54.0,148.5 51.5,143.8' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='27.9,91.2 29.8,96.1 31.8,101.0 33.8,105.7 35.8,110.3 37.7,114.8 39.7,119.2 41.7,123.6 43.6,127.8 45.6,132.0 47.6,136.0 49.5,140.0 51.5,143.8 53.5,147.6 55.5,151.2 57.4,154.8 59.4,158.3 61.4,161.7 63.3,165.0 65.3,168.1 67.3,171.2 69.2,174.2 71.2,177.1 73.2,180.0 75.2,182.7 77.1,185.3 79.1,187.8 81.1,190.2 83.0,192.6 85.0,194.8 87.0,197.0 88.9,199.0 90.9,201.0 92.9,199.1 94.8,197.3 96.8,195.7 98.8,194.1 100.8,192.6 102.7,191.2 104.7,190.0 106.7,188.8 108.6,187.7 110.6,186.7 112.6,185.8 114.5,185.0 116.5,184.2 118.5,183.6 120.5,183.1 122.4,182.7 124.4,182.3 126.4,182.1 128.3,182.0 130.3,181.9 132.3,182.0 134.2,182.1 136.2,182.3 138.2,182.7 140.2,183.1 142.1,183.6 144.1,184.2 146.1,185.0 148.0,185.8 150.0,186.7 152.0,187.7 153.9,188.8 155.9,190.0 157.9,191.2 159.8,192.6 161.8,194.1 163.8,195.7 165.8,197.3 167.7,199.1 169.7,201.0 171.7,199.0 173.6,197.0 175.6,194.8 177.6,192.6 179.5,190.2 181.5,187.8 183.5,185.3 185.5,182.7 187.4,180.0 189.4,177.1 191.4,174.2 193.3,171.2 195.3,168.1 197.3,165.0 199.2,161.7 201.2,158.3 203.2,154.8 205.2,151.2 207.1,147.6 209.1,143.8 211.1,140.0 213.0,136.0 215.0,132.0 217.0,127.8 218.9,123.6 220.9,119.2 222.9,114.8 224.8,110.3 226.8,105.7 228.8,101.0 230.8,96.1 232.7,91.2 234.7,86.2 236.7,81.1 238.6,76.0 240.6,70.7 242.6,65.3 244.5,59.8 246.5,54.2 248.5,48.6 250.5,42.8 252.4,37.0 254.4,31.0 256.4,25.0 258.3,18.8 260.3,12.6 262.3,6.2 264.2,-0.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,159.0 104.0,118.4 188.1,77.8 272.1,37.1' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='51.5' cy='143.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='11.5' y='137.8'>(−1,3)</text><circle cx='248.5' cy='48.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='214.5' y='44.6'>(4,8)</text><text x='138.2' y='170.5' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='193.3' y='56.2' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>g</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 201.0H294.0M90.9 234.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='51.5' y1='198.0' x2='51.5' y2='204.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='48.5' y='215.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='130.3' y1='198.0' x2='130.3' y2='204.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='127.3' y='215.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='169.7' y1='198.0' x2='169.7' y2='204.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='166.7' y='215.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='209.1' y1='198.0' x2='209.1' y2='204.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='206.1' y='215.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='248.5' y1='198.0' x2='248.5' y2='204.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='245.5' y='215.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='87.9' y1='162.9' x2='93.9' y2='162.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.9' y='166.9' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='87.9' y1='124.8' x2='93.9' y2='124.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.9' y='128.8' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='87.9' y1='86.7' x2='93.9' y2='86.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.9' y='90.7' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='87.9' y1='48.6' x2='93.9' y2='48.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.9' y='52.6' font-size='10'>8</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((-1,3)\\) y \\((4,8)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=4\\) la recta queda por encima de \\(f\\). Como \\(f\\) cambia de expresión en \\(0\\) y en \\(2\\), separo:</p>\\[A=\\int_{-1}^4(x+4)\\,dx-\\int_{-1}^4f(x)\\,dx\\]\\[\\int_{-1}^4(x+4)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^2}2+4x\\Bigr]_{-1}^4=24-\\left(-\\frac72\\right)=\\frac{55}2\\]\\[\\int_{-1}^0(x^2-2x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}3-x^2\\Bigr]_{-1}^0=\\frac43\\qquad\\int_0^2(2x-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[x^2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^2=\\frac43\\]\\[\\int_2^4(x^2-2x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}3-x^2\\Bigr]_2^4=\\frac{16}3+\\frac43=\\frac{20}3\\]\\[A=\\frac{55}2-\\left(\\frac43+\\frac43+\\frac{20}3\\right)=\\frac{55}2-\\frac{28}3=\\frac{109}6\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{109}6\\approx18{,}17\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
