  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&m+1&0\\\\1&1&m-1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina los valores de \\(m\\) para los que los vectores fila de \\(M\\) son linealmente independientes.",
     "(1 p.) Estudia el rango de \\(M\\) según los valores de \\(m\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Para \\(m=1\\), calcula la inversa de \\(M\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Los vectores fila son linealmente independientes si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=3\\), es decir, \\(|M|\\neq0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Las filas de una matriz cuadrada son linealmente independientes si y solo si su determinante no es nulo.</i>. Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|M|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&m+1&0\\\\1&1&m-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(m^{2} - 1+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(- m - 1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=m^2+m=m(m+1)\\]\\[|M|=0\\iff\\boxed{m=0}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{m=-1}\\]<div class='res'>Son linealmente independientes si \\(m\\neq0\\) y \\(m\\neq-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m\\neq0,-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(|M|\\neq0\\), \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=3\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&1&0\\\\1&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(|M|=0\\) y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\0&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=2\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&0&0\\\\1&1&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(|M|=0\\) y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\1&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\) (filas 1 y 3): \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}M=3\\) si \\(m\\neq0,-1\\); \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=2\\) si \\(m=0\\) o \\(m=-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para \\(m=1\\), \\(M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&2&0\\\\1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\). Su determinante, por la regla de Sarrus:</p>\\[|M|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&2&0\\\\1&1&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-2+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\]<p>Como \\(|M|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(M^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|M|}(\\operatorname{Adj}M)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}M=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & -2\\\\-1 & 1 & -1\\\\2 & 0 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow M^{-1}=\\frac1{2}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -1 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\-2 & -1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & - \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0\\\\-1 & - \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(M^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & - \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0\\\\-1 & - \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(M\\cdot M^{-1}=I\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
