  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(r\\) la recta que pasa por el punto \\((1,0,0)\\) y tiene como vector dirección \\((a,2a,1)\\) y sea \\(s\\) la recta dada por \\(\\begin{cases}-2x+y=-2\\\\-ax+z=0\\end{cases}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula los valores de \\(a\\) para los que \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) son paralelas.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula, para \\(a=1\\), la distancia entre \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(s\\) a paramétricas. Con \\(x=\\lambda\\): \\(y=-2+2\\lambda\\), \\(z=a\\lambda\\). Pasa por \\(S(0,-2,0)\\) con director \\(\\vec v=(1,2,a)\\).</p><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(1,0,0)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(a,2a,1)\\). Son paralelas si los directores son proporcionales y \\(R\\notin s\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si además \\(R\\) estuviese en \\(s\\), las rectas serían coincidentes, no paralelas.</i>:</p>\\[\\frac a1=\\frac{2a}2=\\frac1a\\iff a^2=1\\iff a=\\pm1\\]<p>\\(R(1,0,0)\\) cumple la primera ecuación de \\(s\\) (\\(-2+0=-2\\)), pero la segunda da \\(-a+0=0\\), falsa para \\(a=\\pm1\\): \\(R\\notin s\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(r\\) y \\(s\\) son paralelas para \\(a=1\\) y para \\(a=-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(a=1\\): \\(r\\equiv(1+t,\\,2t,\\,t)\\) y \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(0,-2,0)\\), las dos con director \\(\\vec d=(1,2,1)\\). La distancia entre dos rectas paralelas es la distancia de un punto de una a la otra<i class='n' data-t='why'>Entre dos rectas paralelas la distancia es la misma desde cualquier punto de una de ellas.</i>. Calculo \\(d(S,r)\\) proyectando \\(S\\) sobre \\(r\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(S\\)<b>:</b> su normal es \\(\\vec d\\): \\(x+2y+z+D=0\\), y con \\(S\\): \\(-4+D=0\\iff D=4\\). Es \\(x+2y+z+4=0\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Corte con </b>\\(r\\)<b>:</b></p>\\[(1+t)+4t+t+4=0\\iff6t+5=0\\iff t=-\\frac56\\Rightarrow M\\left(\\frac16,\\,-\\frac53,\\,-\\frac56\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia:</b></p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{SM}|=\\left|\\left(\\frac16,\\frac13,-\\frac56\\right)\\right|=\\sqrt{\\frac{1+4+25}{36}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}6\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-24,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.6,-3.2,-1.6],[1.9,1.8,0.9],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.9,1.8,0.9],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-0.8,-3.6,-0.8],[1.6,1.2,1.6],\"#7c3aed\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.6,1.2,1.6],\"s\",\"#7c3aed\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1,0,0],[1.367,0.735,0.367],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"line\",[0,-2,0],[0.167,-1.667,-0.833],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[0.112,-1.776,-0.559],[0.234,-1.531,-0.437],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.234,-1.531,-0.437],[0.289,-1.422,-0.711],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"R\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,-2,0],\"S\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.167,-1.667,-0.833],\"M\",-16,12]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 221' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m13ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m13ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m13ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m13ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='47.3' y1='167.9' x2='314.0' y2='51.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='51.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='129.9' x2='282.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='288.0' y='18.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='218.0' y1='93.3' x2='257.2' y2='76.1' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m13ja4d)'/><text x='261.2' y='72.1' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='111.3' y1='92.6' x2='129.1' y2='132.1' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='123.3' y1='119.1' x2='136.3' y2='113.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='136.3' y1='113.4' x2='142.2' y2='126.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='218.0' cy='93.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='225.0' y='87.3' font-weight='700'>R</text><circle cx='111.3' cy='92.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='118.3' y='86.6' font-weight='700'>S</text><circle cx='129.1' cy='132.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='113.1' y='144.1' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='191' x2='30.5' y2='193.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='29.8' y='197.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='191' x2='38.6' y2='190.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.7' y='193.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='191' x2='24.0' y2='175.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='173.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,213)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,213)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,213)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,s)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}6\\approx0{,}913\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\frac{|\\overrightarrow{RS}\\times\\vec d|}{|\\vec d|}=\\frac{|(-2,1,0)|}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}6\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
