  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Comprueba que \\(A^2=2I\\) y calcula \\(A^{-1}\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula \\(A^{2013}\\) y su inversa."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\0&2\\end{pmatrix}=2I\\ ✓\\]<p>De \\(A^2=2I\\) se deduce \\(A\\cdot\\frac12A=I\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si \\(AB=I\\), entonces \\(B=A^{-1}\\).</i>:</p>\\[A^{-1}=\\frac12A=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&\\frac12\\\\\\frac12&-\\frac12\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac12A=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&\\frac12\\\\\\frac12&-\\frac12\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(2013=2\\cdot1006+1\\):</p>\\[A^{2013}=(A^2)^{1006}\\cdot A=(2I)^{1006}A=2^{1006}A=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{1006}&2^{1006}\\\\2^{1006}&-2^{1006}\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[(A^{2013})^{-1}=(2^{1006}A)^{-1}=2^{-1006}A^{-1}=2^{-1006}\\cdot\\frac12A=2^{-1007}A\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{2013}=2^{1006}A\\) y \\((A^{2013})^{-1}=\\dfrac1{2^{1007}}A=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{-1007}&2^{-1007}\\\\2^{-1007}&-2^{-1007}\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "pot",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "a"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2013-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-junio-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera los puntos \\(P(2,3,1)\\) y \\(Q(0,1,1)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi\\) respecto del cual \\(P\\) y \\(Q\\) son simétricos.",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula la distancia de \\(P\\) a \\(\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(P\\) y \\(Q\\) son simétricos respecto de \\(\\pi\\) si \\(\\pi\\) es perpendicular al segmento \\(PQ\\) y pasa por su punto medio<i class='n' data-t='why'>Es el plano mediador del segmento: el lugar de los puntos que equidistan de \\(P\\) y de \\(Q\\).</i>.</p><p><b>Vector normal:</b> \\(\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(-2,-2,0)\\parallel(1,1,0)\\).</p><p><b>Punto medio:</b> \\(M=\\left(\\frac{2+0}2,\\frac{3+1}2,\\frac{1+1}2\\right)=(1,2,1)\\).</p><p>El plano es de la forma \\(x+y+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(M\\): \\(1+2+D=0\\iff D=-3\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":3,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0.151,2.849,-1.6],[0.151,2.849,3.6],[1.849,1.151,3.6],[1.849,1.151,-1.6]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.849,1.151,3.6],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2,3,1],[0,1,1],\"#16a34a\",2.0,false],[\"pt\",[2,3,1],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,1],\"Q\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,2,1],\"M\",8,14]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m13jb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m13jb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m13jb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m13jb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='103.0,225.2 103.0,18.0 28.3,38.8 28.3,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='32.3' y='38.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='105.3' y1='145.6' x2='26.0' y2='118.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0'/><circle cx='105.3' cy='145.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='112.3' y='139.6' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='118.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='112.4' font-weight='700'>Q</text><circle cx='65.6' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='73.6' y='146.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='23.2' y2='274.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='280.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='274.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\pi\\equiv x+y-3=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(M\\) es el punto de \\(\\pi\\) más cercano a \\(P\\): el segmento \\(PM\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\). Por tanto</p>\\[d(P,\\pi)=|\\overrightarrow{PM}|=|(-1,-1,0)|=\\sqrt2\\]<div class='res'>\\(d(P,\\pi)=\\sqrt2\\approx1{,}414\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula: \\(\\frac{|2+3-3|}{\\sqrt2}=\\frac2{\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "geom",
     "tipo": "simet",
     "apartados": "a"
